BT /F1 9 Tf 55.00 352.00 Td (Chaining grows slowly: expected success ~1+alpha/2, miss ~alpha. Measured values follow theory.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 55.00 338.00 Td (Linear probing grows much faster near high load: primary clustering causes long probe sequences.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 55.00 324.00 Td (At alpha=0.9, probing hit/miss costs spike \(5.49 / 52.74\) while chaining remains small \(1.44 / 0.87\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 55.00 310.00 Td (This matches theory: E[hit]=1/2*\(1+1/\(1-alpha\)\), E[miss]=1/2*\(1+1/\(1-alpha\)^2\).) Tj ET
